url: "https://bjbeyond81.github.io/phoenix-experiment-dataset/"
abstract: >-
  Descriptive dataset of public exchanges on X (5 Aug – 13 Nov 2026, plus 2
  pre-window context rows) in which @BJ_Beyond and @BJ_hal addressed @grok and
  a Grok-generated image appeared. 55 rows, 51 Grok replies with media, 58
  unique images (referenced by Post ID and SHA256 only, not redistributed).
  Photos only, no denominator, small n; authorship of prompts is author
  testimony; any mechanism is a hypothesis.
keywords:
  - Phoenix Experiment
  - Grok
  - xAI
  - image generation
  - human judgment
  - Human Edge
  - ritual convergence
  - dataset
